{
 "id": "ls20_planning",
 "version": "1.0.0",
 "depends_on": [
  "shape_decode_loop"
 ],
 "area": "retina",
 "description": "ls20 PLANNING/EXECUTION (block 218000): the salience->investigate->act loop as graph rules. SALIENCE = the symbol<->goal mismatch (surprise->ORIENT); INVESTIGATE = recognise the required transform (217000 sd-loop) and seek the matching station; ACT = deliver when the carried symbol matches. Goal-blind (plan_blind) and blind-detour (plan_detour_*) are the controls it must beat. Guarded on game.plan_on==1 (default-OFF, byte-identical otherwise) and on game.arm. Integer-native; no Rust; reuses the existing shape_decode_loop.",
 "microtheory": {
  "name": "ls20_planning",
  "description": "Salience surfaces the mismatch; investigation recognises the required transform and the means to perform it; the act follows. The goal is an attractor, never a blinder \u2014 every where-to-go decision is a rule."
 },
